2026-11-01 05:53:37,804 INFO rag_from_scratch_v1.processing.query Query='can you tell me about the cooling off period?' Response="**Cooling-off period:**\n\n- **Duration:** 30 days after applying for (or renewing) a BZI product and receiving the PDS. [Page 5]\n- **Refund:** Full refund of premiums paid, less non-refundable government charges, taxes and levies. [Page 5]\n- **Exceptions:** No refund if you've made a claim, exercised any right or power under the policy, or the policy has ended. [Page 5]\n- **How:** Request via your intermediary. [Page 5]\n- **After 30 days:** You can still cancel anytime (see 'Cancellation', page 58). [Page 5]\n- **Renewals:** The cooling-off period applies on each renewal. [Page 7]" chunk=[('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:5', 0.38), ('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:7', 0.29)] time_taken=4.417022399837151 input_tokens=1949 output_tokens=289
2026-11-02 05:21:00,485 INFO rag_from_scratch_v1.processing.query Query='can you tell me about the cooling off period?' Response="**Cooling-off period:**\n\n- **Duration:** You have 30 days after applying for (or renewing) a BZI product and receiving the PDS to check that the policy meets your needs. [Page 5]\n- **Refund:** Cancelling within this time gets you a full refund of premiums paid, less any non-refundable government charges, taxes and levies that BZI has paid and cannot recover. [Page 5]\n- **Exceptions:** No refund applies if:\n  - you have made a claim under your policy; or\n  - you have exercised any right or power in respect of your policy, or the policy has ended. [Page 5]\n- **How to cancel:** Send your request through your intermediary. [Page 5]\n- **Renewals:** The cooling-off period applies to each renewal. [Page 7]\n- **After the period:** You can still cancel at any time. See 'Cancellation' under 'General terms and conditions' (page 58). [Page 5]" chunk=[('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:5', 0.38), ('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:7', 0.29)] time_taken=4.8750607999973 input_tokens=1949 output_tokens=361
2026-11-02 06:42:25,486 INFO rag_from_scratch_v1.processing.query Query='can you tell me about the cooling off period?' Response="**Cooling-off period:**\n\n- You have **30 days** after applying for (or renewing) a BZI product and receiving the PDS to check the policy meets your needs. [Page 5]\n- Within this time, you may cancel for a **full refund** of premiums paid, less any non-refundable government charges, taxes and levies we have paid and cannot recover. [Page 5]\n- **Exceptions:** No refund applies if:\n  - you have made a claim under your policy; or\n  - you have exercised any right or power under your policy, or the policy has ended. [Page 5]\n- Cancellation requests must go through your intermediary. [Page 5]\n- You can cancel your policy at any time after the cooling-off period (see 'Cancellation', page 58). [Page 5]\n- The cooling-off period applies on **each renewal**. [Page 7]" chunk=[('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:5', 0.38), ('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:7', 0.29)] time_taken=3.8698598998598754 input_tokens=1949 output_tokens=316
2026-11-02 07:09:12,019 INFO rag_from_scratch_v1.processing.query Query='can you tell me about the cooling off period?' Response="**Cooling-off period:**\n\n- You have **30 days** after applying for (or renewing) a BZI product and receiving the PDS to check the policy meets your needs. [Page 5]\n- Within this time, you may cancel for a **full refund** of premiums paid, less any non-refundable government charges, taxes and levies we have paid and cannot recover. [Page 5]\n- This does not apply if:\n  - you have made a claim under your policy; or\n  - you have exercised any right or power under your policy, or the policy has ended. [Page 5]\n- Your request must be forwarded to us via your intermediary. [Page 5]\n- You can cancel at any time after the cooling-off period (see 'Cancellation', page 58). [Page 5]\n- The cooling-off period applies on each renewal. [Page 7]" chunk=[('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:5', 0.38), ('Motor_Insurance_Comprehensive:page:7', 0.29)] time_taken=3.8104462001938373 input_tokens=1949 output_tokens=305
